+### Assign a ticket: `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee`
+
+Send `{ "assignee": "Dana" }`, or `{ "assignee": null }` to unassign. Names are trimmed, non-empty single-line text of at most 64 characters. Answers 200 with the ticket. Only open and in-progress tickets allow this operation; other states answer 409 `conflict`. An unchanged assignment leaves no audit entry or notification and keeps `updated`. Each new assignment records `ticket.assigned` in the audit log and enqueues a notification to the new agent. Unassignment sends no notification.
